      "comment": "POWER ROLEX (8) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (17.61) at this track behind Rockin' Mia in a Grade 5. Stalked the pace but found the line strongly. The form out of his last race has been franked. Winning claims. GORGEOUS GOSSIP (6) has been in the money at her last two runs, most recently when second beaten 0.8 lengths (17.54). Goes well here including a win and three minors. Has good early speed and can overcome the tricky draw. Deserves a win and gets her chance. ZIPPING SINNER (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing eighth (18.17) in a Grade 5 at this track. Likely to be thereabouts. NOAH'S OWN (1) can sneak into the finish.",
